     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi Phil,</div><div> </div><div>I am trying to figure out how the df for X_2 statistic is calculated. I read the articles that you referenced in the itemfit section, and they give examples of several methods in which df can be calculated (e.g., some take into account the intervals in which the responders are divided, others take into consideration the number of parameters estimated etc. ) I assume that the X_2 calculated in mirt for item fit takes into consideration the number of groups the responders are divided into, because there is an option to specify approximately how many subjects are in each group, correct?</div><div> </div><div>I am also wondering why I would be getting negative df. It seems like that should not be happening:</div><div> </div><div> <table style=\"width:336pt;border-collapse:collapse\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"448\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height:15pt\" height=\"20\"><td style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;height:15pt;background-color:transparent\" height=\"20\" width=\"64\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">Zh</font></td><td style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;background-color:transparent\" width=\"64\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">X2</font></td><td style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;background-color:transparent\" width=\"64\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">df</font></td><td style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;background-color:transparent\" width=\"64\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">p.X2</font></td><td style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;background-color:transparent\" width=\"64\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">S_X2</font></td><td style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;background-color:transparent\" width=\"64\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">df.S_X2</font></td><td style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;background-color:transparent\" width=\"64\"><p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">p.S_X2</font></p></td></tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table><table style=\"width:336pt;border-collapse:collapse\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"448\">\r\n <colgroup><col style=\"width:48pt\" span=\"7\" width=\"64\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"height:15pt\" height=\"20\">\r\n\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;height:15pt;background-color:yellow\" height=\"20\" width=\"64\" align=\"right\"><font style=\"background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">-0.0187</font></td><td><font style=\"background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">\r\n  </font><td style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;background-color:yellow\" width=\"64\" align=\"right\"><font style=\"background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">0.1518</font></td><td><font style=\"background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">\r\n  </font><td style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;background-color:yellow\" width=\"64\" align=\"right\"><font style=\"background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">-2</font></td><td><font style=\"background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">\r\n  </font><td style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;background-color:yellow\" width=\"64\"><font style=\"background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">NaN</font></td><td><font style=\"background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">\r\n  </font><td style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;background-color:yellow\" width=\"64\" align=\"right\"><font style=\"background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">14.1931</font></td><td><font style=\"background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">\r\n  </font><td style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;background-color:yellow\" width=\"64\" align=\"right\"><font style=\"background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">10</font></td><td><font style=\"background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">\r\n  </font><td sty