     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div>How large is your sample size? It&#39;s possible that if it&#39;s too small then very few bins could be created, and the df = #bins - #est_pars; could very well be negative.</div><div><br></div><div>Phil</div><div> </div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"></blockquote></div></div></div>"
